## 2. CORE PLATFORM MODULES

### Module 1: Customer Moving & Freight Application (Web / Mobile PWA)
* **Vehicle & Moving Category Selector:**
  * *Light Haulage & Express Delivery:* Dispatch cargo vans, mini-buses, and pickup trucks for quick parcel and appliance transport.
  * *Residential Relocation:* 1.5-Ton and 3-Ton box trucks for 1-bedroom to 3-bedroom apartment moves.
  * *Heavy Haulage & Industrial Relocation:* 5-Ton to 10-Ton covered and flatbed trucks for full corporate offices, commercial freight, and warehouse distribution.
* **Interactive Cargo & Move Manifest Builder:**
  * Point-to-point route selection powered by interactive Leaflet/OpenStreetMap mapping with automated distance calculation.
  * Move details checklist: itemized furniture list, fragile item declarations, floor level (ground, 1st, 2nd+), and elevator availability.
  * Optional Helper Crew Toggle: Request dedicated loading and offloading porters/helpers alongside the vehicle.
  * Photo Attachment: Customers can upload photos of bulky or delicate goods for accurate driver evaluation.
* **Dual Booking Modes (Bolt + inDrive Mechanics):**
  * *Standard Express Match (Bolt Model):* Instant automated fare calculation based on truck category, base flag-fall fee, and distance. The system broadcasts to the nearest available driver for immediate pickup.
  * *Fare Bidding & Negotiation (inDrive Model):* Customer submits their cargo manifest with their proposed budget. Drivers receive real-time audio/visual alerts, review the cargo photos, and either accept the offer or submit a counter-bid. The customer chooses their preferred mover based on price, truck photos, arrival ETA, and driver rating.
* **Live GPS Tracking & Safety:**
  * Real-time vehicle location tracking as the truck approaches the pickup point and en route to the destination.
  * Full driver identification: driver full name, phone number, vehicle plate number, truck color, and verified mover badge.
* **Secure Delivery & In-App Communication:**
  * Masked in-app calling and messaging button connecting customer and driver without revealing personal phone numbers if desired.
  * **Delivery Confirmation OTP:** A 4-digit security code generated for the customer that must be entered by the driver upon successful cargo offloading to formally mark the job complete and release payouts.

