### Module 2: Driver, Trucker & Mover Partner Application (Web / Mobile PWA)
* **Driver Onboarding & Fleet Verification Portal:**
  * Self-service registration interface collecting driver license, vehicle particulars, roadworthiness documentation, truck interior/exterior photos, and bank account details (NUBAN) for automated payouts.
  * Specification of vehicle capacity (tonnage, dimensions, open bed vs enclosed box) and availability of onboard moving labor/helpers.
* **Real-Time Job Radar & Bidding Terminal:**
  * One-tap Online / Offline duty status toggle.
  * High-priority visual and audio radar alerts when a moving or haulage job is broadcast within the driver's operating radius.
  * Full job preview: pickup and drop-off addresses, distance, cargo description, photos, helper requirements, and customer's proposed fare.
  * Interactive Bidding Interface: Drivers can tap to accept the proposed fare instantly or select one-touch counter-offers (+₦3,000, +₦5,000, +₦10,000, or a custom price).
* **Navigation Handover & Job Workflow:**
  * One-touch bridge passing pickup and destination GPS coordinates directly into Google Maps or Waze on the driver's phone for turn-by-turn truck routing.
  * Move progress checkpoints: "Arrived at Pickup" -> "Loading Complete / In Transit" -> "Arrived at Destination" -> "Offloading Finished".
  * Pre-move condition verification: ability for drivers to snap photos of pre-existing cargo damage prior to loading to eliminate false claims.
* **Earnings Wallet & Commission Engine:**
  * Comprehensive dashboard displaying daily, weekly, and monthly gross earnings, completed trip tallies, and customer ratings.
  * In-app wallet tracking cash-collected commissions owed to PHP Movers and digital wallet balances available for payout.

