### Module 3: Central Operations & Master Admin Dashboard (PHP Movers HQ)
* **Fleet & Partner Verification Desk:**
  * Administrative review console to inspect uploaded driver credentials, vehicle papers, and truck photos before activating driver accounts.
  * Ability to suspend, flag, or permanently deactivate non-compliant drivers or vehicles failing road safety standards.
* **Live Operations Control Tower & Dispatch Monitor:**
  * Live administrative map displaying all online vehicles, active loading jobs, in-transit trucks, and completed moves across target operating regions.
  * Real-time search and filter by vehicle classification (Vans, 1.5-Ton, 3-Ton, 5-Ton, 10-Ton).
* **Dynamic Commission & Tariff Management Engine:**
  * Configure baseline tariff formulas for instant Bolt-style dispatches (base charge + per-kilometer rate + waiting time rate).
  * Configure PHP Movers platform service commission percentages (e.g., 10% to 15% per completed move) with automated commission deduction from driver digital wallets.
  * Define surcharge rules for specialized labor (e.g., helper porter fees, heavy appliance carrying fees).
* **Financial Ledger & Settlement Records:**
  * Master ledger recording total platform gross merchandise value (GMV), net PHP Movers commission revenues, driver payout obligations, and payment gateway settlement records.
* **Dispute Resolution, Insurance Claims & Support Hub:**
  * Complete audit trail for every completed, cancelled, or contested move including chat logs, timestamps, cargo photos, and customer ratings.
  * Emergency SOS and support ticket management desk.

